{"3630200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "妖恋西游", "steam_appid": 3630200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/cacd1a6e04aa2ce9d418b8f33d090fb4.webp?t=1774486786\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/00c7afcb86b20223942f357c18b5cfdc.avif?t=1774486786\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/4364249ec907b3799f4316737e31b123.avif?t=1774486786\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/25da97f1a0acc30f5ff6c5ab4fbbece6.webp?t=1774486786\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/d28158f309055cb27f57333ac28e66ff.avif?t=1774486786\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>平平无奇的晚上，你与一起在便利店打工的学妹下班回家。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>但在前往地铁站的小道上，却传来令人毛骨悚然的求救声。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>这一刻，你的命运即将改变，你并不知道，自己即将被卷入巨大的命运旋涡当中。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>重走西行之路……</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>重塑秩序，修正因果……</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>这是你必须做的事情，也是只有你才能做的事情……</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/b6c4ac6684eb14573f39d1f2bf33d38d.avif?t=1774486786\" width=600 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/607b54aece0dc9c50606d22f5be8a306.webp?t=1774486786\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/21af1b88ef52c1aaafbb5e3d83ec0ef6.avif?t=1774486786\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>剧情特色</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>· 高质量AVG演出效果</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>· 十余张精美CG（差分超过40枚）</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>· 20万字无水剧情内容，无尿点，不瞌睡</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>· 正统王道后宫冒险剧情，无雷点，放心看</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/03ff6a02ab356613212686d76187df87.avif?t=1774486786\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>战斗特色</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>· 正统STG竖版卷轴射击，华丽弹幕，爽快战斗</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>· 穿梭于弹幕地狱之间，挑战高难度的关卡，成就满满</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>· 融入RPG养成，多种僚机搭配组合，攻击流、防御流、暴击流、DOT流，玩法多种多样</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>· 血条设计，降低游戏难度，弹幕苦手也可轻松通关</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>· Rougelike无尽模式，满足你的刷子欲望</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/dc7be13a1f543c3933645a246c5a0fa5.avif?t=1774486786\" width=600 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「呜呜……我不想取经了，我要回高老庄……」​​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >主人公的二徒弟，一开始迎接主人公的人之一。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >胆小怕事，战斗力较弱但生存技能满点，是队伍里的后勤担当，擅长烹饪和家务，虽然有时候会抱怨，但还是会为大家做一桌好菜。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >总在出行前清点行囊里的装备和止血草药，在裙摆暗袋里缝上零钱和甜糕，以备不时之需。和小白龙是好朋友，在曾经的取经路上因为总被大师兄捉弄，所以对悟空有些忌惮和敬畏。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在上次取经之后，回到高老庄生活，但……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/20fffdbdf67aac7a07e2000f593071f6.avif?t=1774486786\" width=584 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「诶呀呀~真是让人伤脑筋， 看来也只能靠小白龙我了~」​​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >主人公的四徒弟，一开始迎接主人公的人之二。为主人公坐骑化形，西海龙宫三公主，</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >温顺乖巧的乐天派，平时是队伍中的话痨担当，会为主人公解释很多事情，能随手从行囊掏出龙宫至宝，却并不知道人间的很多常识，常常拿珍贵的至宝换来几个铜钱请大家吃糖葫芦。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >当暴雨来临时，她藏在裙摆下的龙尾就会展现出来，这也是少有的她会害羞的地方。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在上次取经之后，她回到西海龙宫过大小姐生活，但是……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/3e79ff1fd7e9f2a5e4a650d3d98d6dcd.avif?t=1774486786\" width=584 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「哼，别以为你是我师父就可以一脸神气！」​​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >听说是主人公大徒弟，看起来是个相当热血的少女。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >金箍棒挥出的弧光总能命中目标，火眼金睛倒映的妖气里，掺杂着说不清的悲悯，虎皮裙的裂痕处缠着褪色红绸。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在上次取经之后，似乎返回了山中，并未再次迎接主人公的到来……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/5e4fe992932a325ebb7518bdd02fde68.avif?t=1774486786\" width=584 height=429 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「各位……师父好像被抓走了……」​​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >听说是主人公三徒弟，看起来是个面无表情的少女。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >可以随时随地保持冷静，战斗时瞳孔会浮现淡金色，降妖宝杖每次挥动都精准卡在敌人攻击的间隙，是个“可靠，但似乎又没那么可靠”的古怪存在。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >上次取经之后，返回了名为流沙河的地方，同大徒弟悟空一样，并未在主人公转世时出现。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/1ef3f530f6e1a01d94d8b0bcf38f8f3b.avif?t=1774486786\" width=584 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「一切，都是缘分……随缘而来，随缘，而去」​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >将主人公召唤至彼方世界的人，灵山至高尊者，三界法则维系者。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >法力通天却热衷观测人间趣事，性格慈悲中透着恶趣味。为解决上一世金蝉子所犯下的罪过，在金蝉子的指引下召唤了主人公。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >对主人公异常关注，随时随地远程指导主人公取经中……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/a274949c5f65c4adc04753503fe73f65.avif?t=1774486786\" width=584 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你是被如来选中的金蝉子转世，肩负着通过恋爱“降服妖怪”的重任。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >前世的金蝉子在暴力镇压妖怪的过程中犯下的错，要由你来逐一解决。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >徒弟，妖怪，现实世界的伙伴……你陷入到了一股巨大的命运漩涡之中……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>玩家群：622828185</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>BiliBili：精文工作室</i></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/cacd1a6e04aa2ce9d418b8f33d090fb4.webp?t=1774486786\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/00c7afcb86b20223942f357c18b5cfdc.avif?t=1774486786\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/4364249ec907b3799f4316737e31b123.avif?t=1774486786\" width=600 height=250 />