，不瞌睡</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>· 正统王道后宫冒险剧情，无雷点，放心看</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/03ff6a02ab356613212686d76187df87.avif?t=1774486786\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>战斗特色</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>· 正统STG竖版卷轴射击，华丽弹幕，爽快战斗</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>· 穿梭于弹幕地狱之间，挑战高难度的关卡，成就满满</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>· 融入RPG养成，多种僚机搭配组合，攻击流、防御流、暴击流、DOT流，玩法多种多样</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>· 血条设计，降低游戏难度，弹幕苦手也可轻松通关</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>· Rougelike无尽模式，满足你的刷子欲望</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/dc7be13a1f543c3933645a246c5a0fa5.avif?t=1774486786\" width=600 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「呜呜……我不想取经了，我要回高老庄……」​​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >主人公的二徒弟，一开始迎接主人公的人之一。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >胆小怕事，战斗力较弱但生存技能满点，是队伍里的后勤担当，擅长烹饪和家务，虽然有时候会抱怨，但还是会为大家做一桌好菜。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >总在出行前清点行囊里的装备和止血草药，在裙摆暗袋里缝上零钱和甜糕，以备不时之需。和小白龙是好朋友，在曾经的取经路上因为总被大师兄捉弄，所以对悟空有些忌惮和敬畏。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在上次取经之后，回到高老庄生活，但……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/20fffdbdf67aac7a07e2000f593071f6.avif?t=1774486786\" width=584 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「诶呀呀~真是让人伤脑筋， 看来也只能靠小白龙我了~」​​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >主人公的四徒弟，一开始迎接主人公的人之二。为主人公坐骑化形，西海龙宫三公主，</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >温顺乖巧的乐天派，平时是队伍中的话痨担当，会为主人公解释很多事情，能随手从行囊掏出龙宫至宝，却并不知道人间的很多常识，常常拿珍贵的至宝换来几个铜钱请大家吃糖葫芦。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >当暴雨来临时，她藏在裙摆下的龙尾就会展现出来，这也是少有的她会害羞的地方。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在上次取经之后，她回到西海龙宫过大小姐生活，但是……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/3e79ff1fd7e9f2a5e4a650d3d98d6dcd.avif?t=1774486786\" width=584 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「哼，别以为你是我师父就可以一脸神气！」​​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >听说是主人公大徒弟，看起来是个相当热血的少女。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >金箍棒挥出的弧光总能命中目标，火眼金睛倒映的妖气里，掺杂着说不清的悲悯，虎皮裙的裂痕处缠着褪色红绸。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在上次取经之后，似乎返回了山中，并未再次迎接主人公的到来……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/5e4fe992932a325ebb7518bdd02fde68.avif?t=1774486786\" width=584 height=429 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「各位……师父好像被抓走了……」​​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >听说是主人公三徒弟，看起来是个面无表情的少女。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >可以随时随地保持冷静，战斗时瞳孔会浮现淡金色，降妖宝杖每次挥动都精准卡在敌人攻击的间隙，是个“可靠，但似乎又没那么可靠”的古怪存在。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >上次取经之后，返回了名为流沙河的地方，同大徒弟悟空一样，并未在主人公转世时出现。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/1ef3f530f6e1a01d94d8b0bcf38f8f3b.avif?t=1774486786\" width=584 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >「一切，都是缘分……随缘而来，随缘，而去」​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >将主人公召唤至彼方世界的人，灵山至高尊者，三界法则维系者。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >法力通天却热衷观测人间趣事，性格慈悲中透着恶趣味。为解决上一世金蝉子所犯下的罪过，在金蝉子的指引下召唤了主人公。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >对主人公异常关注，随时随地远程指导主人公取经中……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/extras/a274949c5f65c4adc04753503fe73f65.avif?t=1774486786\" width=584 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你是被如来选中的金蝉子转世，肩负着通过恋爱“降服妖怪”的重任。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >前世的金蝉子在暴力镇压妖怪的过程中犯下的错，要由你来逐一解决。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >徒弟，妖怪，现实世界的伙伴……你陷入到了一股巨大的命运漩涡之中……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>玩家群：622828185</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>BiliBili：精文工作室</i></strong></p>", "short_description": "普通大学生的你，因意外转生到彼方世界，成为被金蝉子选中的新任“金身”。 《西游记》中的各路角色，竟然以女孩子的形象在你面前接连出现。 而你想要回到原来的世界，就必须完成“如来佛祖”交给你的任务。 与各路妖怪们重新结缘，解决前任金身“唐叄藏”犯下的各种错误，重走西行之路，再塑秩序和因果……", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/9d8b533ff5e9cc244df61eb3df9f7105b74e34b5/header.jpg?t=1774486786", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/7e85d10c7c19d3184b1c014875d2cf93201c40e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774486786", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630200/7e85d10c7c19d3184b1c014875d2cf93201c40e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774486786", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 所有<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["精文工作室"], "publishers": ["北京精文极造信息技术有限公司"], "demos": [{"appid": 3874700, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 78, "description": "Adjustable Difficulty"}, {"id": 75, "description": "Keyboard Only Option"}, {"id": 76, "description": "Mouse Only Option"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 65, "description": "Subtitle Options"}, {"id": 